sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BR as 🧑‍🎓 Student Browser
    participant NGX as Nginx LB
    participant APP as Laravel<br/>(Controller · Middleware)
    participant FV as FaceVerificationService<br/>+ AiLoadBalancer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant KV as Valkey<br/>(queue · pub/sub)
    participant AI as FastAPI AI<br/>(YOLOv8 + InsightFace)
    participant QW as Queue Worker
    participant RV as Reverb WS
    participant ADM as 👩‍💼 Admin Monitor

    Note over BR,RV: ── ① เปิดหน้าสแกน QR ──
    BR->>NGX: GET /scan
    NGX->>APP: route student.scanner
    APP-->>BR: checkin/scan.blade

    Note over BR,RV: ── ② สแกน QR ได้ token ──
    BR->>NGX: POST /check-in/{token}
    NGX->>APP: auth middleware
    APP->>DB: lookup activities.qr_token<br/>(+ qr_expires_at)
    DB-->>APP: activity ✓ (status ongoing)

    alt กิจกรรมไม่บังคับยืนยันใบหน้า
        APP->>DB: DB::transaction insert attendances<br/>method=qr_scan · UNIQUE(user+activity)
        APP-->>BR: 🎉 success screen
    else บังคับ face_scan
        loop จับกล้องทุก frame
            BR->>NGX: POST /check-in/{token}/verify-frame (base64)
            NGX->>APP: middleware face-verify
            APP->>FV: verify(frame, user)
            FV->>AI: POST /verify<br/>Header X-API-Key
            Note over AI: YOLOv8 detect face<br/>InsightFace extract embedding
            AI-->>FV: embedding + best_match score

            alt similarity ไม่ผ่าน threshold
                FV-->>APP: ✗ no match
                APP->>DB: insert security_logs<br/>(risk scoring · device_fingerprint)
                APP-->>BR: ❌ 401 retry
            else ผ่าน
                FV->>AI: POST /liveness (anti-spoofing)
                alt liveness ไม่ผ่าน
                    FV-->>APP: ✗ spoof suspected
                    APP-->>BR: ❌ retry / selfie review
                else liveness ผ่าน
                    FV-->>APP: ✓ identity confirmed
                    APP->>DB: DB::transaction<br/>insert attendances method=qr_scan+selfie
                    APP->>KV: dispatch AttendeeCheckedIn<br/>+ SendLineNotificationJob
                    APP-->>BR: ✅ JSON success
                end
            end
        end
    end

    %% Async realtime fan-out
    KV--)QW: pop AttendeeCheckedIn
    QW->>DB: mark registration completed
    QW->>RV: publish private channel
    Note over RV: channel แจ้งเตือน<br/>admin dashboard สด
    RV--)ADM: echo .listen('.AttendeeCheckedIn')
    QW--)AI: LINE API notify (queue: notifications)
